# RESEARCHER USE ONLY - do not put participant credentials in this file.
#
# This writes a WiFi passphrase in plaintext to a FAT partition that anyone
# holding the SD card can read. Participants configure their home network
# through the device's own setup portal instead, which never stores the
# passphrase at all (see docs/participant.md).
#
# Use this only to preload your own lab network at imaging time. Drop the file
# (renamed to `obd-ev-wifi.conf`) onto the BOOT partition before first boot.
# Each block describes one network; the Pi auto-connects to whichever is in
# range.
#
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Blank lines are fine. Separate networks
# with a line of three dashes.

ssid=MyHomeWiFi
psk=mypassword

---

ssid=Backup
psk=otherpassword
